This directory contains the pw users guide.  The program pwmanfig
gets a figure and x-window undumps it.  You must customize the
script to point to the correct directory.

The file notes.fig.sizes gives the scale factors for xwud dumpung the
figures to an HP paintjet XL 300 (300 dots per inch).


The manual at this point should be considered a rough draft, but
should get users fully functional.
